<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to RLIFE!</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .email-header {
            background: #fa709a;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .celebration {
            font-size: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .email-header h1 {
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        .email-body {
            padding: 50px 40px;
        }
        
        .success-badge {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .message {
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .message strong {
            color: #111827;
        }
        
        .highlight {
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .message a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .cta-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #667eea !important;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none !important;
            padding: 18px 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .email-footer {
            background: #111827;
            color: #d1d5db;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .email-footer strong {
            color: #f9fafb;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="email-header" style="background: #fa709a; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%); padding: 60px 40px; text-align: center;">
            <div class="celebration" style="font-size: 60px; margin-bottom: 20px;">🎊</div>
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">You're All Set!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="email-body">
            <div class="success-badge">
                <span class="badge">✅ Account Verified</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                <strong>Congratulations, {{ user.firstName }}!</strong>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                Your account has been successfully verified. You're now part of the <span class="highlight">RLIFE community</span> – join thousands of students who are already transforming their academic journey!
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                Ready to start organizing your semester? Click below to access your personalized dashboard:
            </div>
            
            <div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
                <a href="{{ url('app_dashboard') }}" class="cta-button" style="display: inline-block; background: #667eea !important; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 18px 50px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4); border: 2px solid #667eea;">
                    🚀 Go to Dashboard
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                Need help getting started? Check out our <a href="#" style="color: #667eea;">quick start guide</a> or reach out to our support team anytime.
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="email-footer">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #f9fafb;">Happy Studying! 📚</div>
            <div style="color: #d1d5db;">The RLIFE Team</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
